# Crossroads_33 from the arrival the Gate Switch in Crossroads_06 opens (x 44.5 y 34.4, the sliding wall gone) over the ledges up to the shaft
# below the top gate, a jump straight up through the gap in the ceiling (x 22.0, the landing the way down used) and into Crossroads_07. Planned with
# hk-walkplan room on the disc (margin 0.4, the wall's box passed as open; the planner does not take a vertical exit from a standing jump, so the last
# jump is written: walk 22.0, jump). The exit is waited for by the arrival in 07 (x 20, y 0.5, six units either way).
